		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=28550#p28550"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>C&#039;est une solution en effet. On peut aussi utiliser le Foreign Data Wrapper d&#039;Andrew Dunstan (<a href="https://github.com/adunstan/file_fixed_length_record_fdw" rel="nofollow">https://github.com/adunstan/file_fixed_ … record_fdw</a>).</p>]]></content>
